# SCAHN — published analysis code.
#
# ALLOWLIST, not a blocklist: everything at the repo root is ignored, and only
# what is published is re-included below. A mistake here makes a file missing,
# never leaked -- which is the point, since this tree also holds ~62 GB of data
# and results, some of it access-restricted.
#
# Deliberately NOT published: data/, results/, figures/, CURATION.md and
# CHANGELOG.md (internal working notes), and any local_* script.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/scripts/

# local_ scripts read restricted data or are local provenance records.
scripts/**/local_*

# Editor / R / Python cruft, in case any appears under scripts/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
